		<div class="mAlbum">
				<h2>국제교류원 소개</h2>
				<div class="list">
					<div class="unit">
							<a href="/international/cms/FR_CON/index.do?MENU_ID=150" target="_self">
								<dl style="background-image:url(/ajaxfile/CMN_SVC/FileView.do?GBN=X04&TEMP_CODE=DEPT_A&CONFIG_CD=C1401&CONFIG_SEQ=2&SITE_NO=42&SUB_SEQ=1)">
